# Docker build context of the demo image (Hugging Face Space; ADR-0039).
# The staging script, scripts/deploy/hf-space-stage.sh, applies the same list.

# CONFIDENTIAL governing documents: never in an image or the Space (ADR-0008).
*.pdf
**/*.pdf
**/*.[Pp][Dd][Ff]
sa/
**/sa/

# Repository internals, local keys, secrets and build output.
.git
.devkeys
var/
.superpowers/
.env*
!.env.example
bin/
